config MEGARAID_LEGACY
	tristate "LSI Logic Legacy MegaRAID Driver"
	depends on PCI && SCSI
	help
	This driver supports the LSI MegaRAID 418, 428, 438, 466, 762, 490
	and 467 SCSI host adapters. This driver also support the all U320
	RAID controllers
